      "zh": "这是什么"
     },
     "style": "header",
     "fontSize": 16,
     "color": "#6e3e28",
     "align": "left",
     "wrap": true
    },
    {
     "type": "line",
     "id": "about_rule",
     "x": 24,
     "y": 49,
     "x2": 296,
     "y2": 49,
     "thickness": 1,
     "arrow": "none",
     "color": "#6e3e28"
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "id": "ab0",
     "x": 24,
     "y": 59,
     "w": 272,
     "h": 42,
     "text": "More Girls is the fourth girlify expansion for Deep Space Pawnshop: Probably Stolen. Every character in it is original.",
     "translations": {
      "zh": "深空娘化原创拓展（More Girls）是《深空当铺》的第四期娘化 mod，全部是原创角色。"
     },
     "style": "body",
     "fontSize": 10,
     "color": "#3a2a22",
     "align": "left",
     "wrap": true
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "id": "ab1",
     "x": 24,
     "y": 110,
     "w": 272,
     "h": 42,
     "text": "It adds store visitors, Wonderland branches, morning events, outdoor encounters, relics with an album, and an official guide book.",
     "translations": {
      "zh": "内容包括：到店的来客、误入奇境的分支、晨间事件、野外遭遇，以及信物、信物集和秘籍。"
     },
     "style": "body",
     "fontSize": 10,
     "color": "#3a2a22",
     "align": "left",
     "wrap": true
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "id": "ab2",
     "x": 24,
     "y": 161,
     "w": 272,
     "h": 28,
     "text": "It needs no other mod, and it runs alongside All Girls without conflict. The two pair well together.",
     "translations": {
      "zh": "不依赖其他 mod，单独启用即可。与「深空娘化：可能是大雷」（All Girls）同时启用也不冲突，两者搭配更完整。"
     },
     "style": "body",
     "fontSize": 10,
     "color": "#3a2a22",
     "align": "left",
     "wrap": true
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "id": "ab3",
     "x": 24,
     "y": 198,
     "w": 272,
     "h": 15,
     "text": "Some portraits were made with generative AI.",
     "translations": {
      "zh": "部分立绘使用了生成式 AI 制作。"
     },
     "style": "body",
     "fontSize": 10,
     "color": "#3a2a22",
     "align": "left",
     "wrap": true
    }
   ]
  },
